  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4003.02 Contents of NHCHIS Registration Form. The NHCHIS registration form for carriers, pharmacy benefit managers, and third-party administrators submitting data under RSA 420-G:11, II shall contain the fields required under Ins 4008.01.\n\nSource. #8279, eff 2-3-05; ss by #9500, eff 7-6-09; ss by #10877, eff 7-10-15; ss by #13136 eff 11-24-20; ss by #14560, eff 4-22-26, EXPIRES: 4-22-36",
